<urn:atm:triage:finding/CPR-023>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "CPR-023" ;
  triage:title "escalate_refusals runs unconditionally every tick, scanning the mailbox per target per tick" ;
  triage:description "Hostile closure review (general-purpose opus, task af4edaf6699568f49) @ 9f5aef2fe. escalate_refusals runs unconditionally every tick, scanning the mailbox per target per tick. Doc says: sprint-BA.3: 'one read per target per episode'. Code does: process_task_candidate calls escalate_refusals before dispose on every tick, including for members that dispose will immediately Hold, and each call performs a list_messages mailbox scan per target. Recommendation: Gate escalate_refusals on the disposition, or memoize the episode check per target." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ba" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "efficiency" ;
  triage:severity "minor" ;
  triage:source "qa" ;
  triage:repeatable false ;
  triage:sweepScope "crates/atm-http-runtime/src/herdr_queue_wake_reminders.rs" ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
  triage:dispatchReady false ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-09-12T07:08:18Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:deferredNote "fenix (ATM 01M2ADZCQ0CZSWBYN826TGSV8N, 2026-09-12T09:08:03Z): pushed by arch-ctm at review-2 739833663 (fix(tasks): gate refusal reads on disposition). Recorded fixed-pending-correction: dispose's refusals-escalated arm became dead because the threshold hold bypasses the disposition table (plan R5 ruling). Correction commit will be the head. fenix (ATM 01M2AE1PD5D61SGTXP6H1DVFJA, 2026-09-12T09:09:18Z): 739833663 is 13-gate-green on fenix's host (cli_surface 2/2); this also closed out CPR-026's tidy head cce076f1c. CPR-023 itself stays fixed-pending-correction at 739833663 until arch-ctm's R5 correction lands. fenix (ATM 01M2AE6S483CSEPPTDHK1REHWC, 2026-09-12T09:12:05Z): remap -- R5 correction commit 50b3f33fc accepted on review (refusal hold re-disposed through the table); status fixed-pending-gate at 50b3f33fc, fenix's gate run in flight. fenix (ATM 01M2AE9VFR8K4EPF2S0VWAYMV9, 2026-09-12T09:13:46Z): arch-ctm's QA found an overlap gap at 50b3f33fc -- nudge-gated refusal read demotes refusal-threshold precedence over mail-pending/stalled. fenix ruled to apply the structural gate (Idle + open head). Reverted to fixed-pending-correction at 50b3f33fc (headSha unchanged pending the next correction commit); fenix's gate run on 50b3f33fc continues as gates-only. fenix (ATM 01M2AEP4Z43YK16XSJJZ2D1QD6, 2026-09-12T09:20:29Z): remap -- overlap correction commit 639f540db accepted on review (refusal read gated on Idle + open head, overlap regression test); status fixed-pending-gate at 639f540db, fenix's gate run in flight. Gate-green confirmed (ATM 01M2AESF4P9F6T674DAK7CTY2H, 2026-09-12T09:22:17Z): 13-gate-green on fenix's host (cli_surface 2/2); CPR-023 closed at 639f540db." ;
  triage:foundIn triage:BA6 ;
